    commands. Any invalid statement will say to use this command)\r\n-Access (unlock
    a locked console with the console\u2019s security question)\r\n-Answer (Answer
    security question)"
  consoleLogs: "  April 1st:\r\n >Open Door\r\n By Niel\r\nDoor unlocked!\r\nMarch
    20th:\r\n>Open Door\r\n By Niel\r\nDoor unlocked!\r\nMarch 18th:\r\n>Message
    Duncan Cole, tell him he spelled my name wrong on the sign. It should be \u201Cwood\u201D,
    not \u201Cwoad\u201D.\r\n By Niel\r\nMessage sent!\r\nMarch 10th:\r\n >Register
    new user, Niel\r\n By Niel\r\nNiel has been registered!\r\n"
  accessQuestion: "What is Niel\u2019s Last Name?"
  accessAnswer: northwood
